# Run skinny-mvvm-wpf-architecture

Read `docs/architecture/skinny-mvvm-wpf-architecture/SKILL.md` and follow the **Agent Instructions** section. The reference document is at `docs/architecture/skinny-mvvm-wpf-architecture/inputs/architecture-reference.md`.

When generating or modifying any ViewModel:

1. Identify the scope (new module / refactor / extraction) using the **Build** section.
2. Use `templates/viewmodel-module.template.txt` as the concrete starting point.
3. Validate the result against every rule in the bundled rules block of `SKILL.md` before completing.
4. Command handlers must be one-liners. Bound properties must be direct domain references. No ViewModel knows another ViewModel exists.
